Features
-------------

Users are assigned to roles and roles are assigned to permissions.


Roles:
        superadmin, 
        admin, 
        editor, 
        contributor, 
        moderator, 
        guest


Operations Management
---------------------
    Operations implemented:

    - Article: create_article, approve_article, delete_article, disable_article, edit_article, edit_own_article,
               enable_article, export_article, publish_article, view_article
    - Comment: add_comment, edit_comment, delete_comment, reject_comment, 
    - Category: add_category, edit_category
    - User: approve_user, delete_user, disable_user, enable_user, modify_own_user, modify_all_users;
    - Dashboard: view_dashboard
    - Logs: archive_all_logs, archive_own_logs, delete_all_logs, delete_own_logs, view_all_logs, view_own_logs
    - Data: backup_data
    - ACLL edit_acl
    - Register: register
    - Search: search
    

Permissions assigned to Roles:

    superadmin: all excluding: register
    admin: all excluding: register, backup_data
    contributor: modify_own_user, view_dashboard, add_comment, view_own_logs, archive_own_logs, delete_own_logs,
                 create_article, edit_article, edit_own_article, view_article, search
    editor: create_article, edit_article, edit_own_article, view_article, add_comment, archive_own_logs, 
                delete_own_logs, view_own_logs, modify_own_user, view_dashboard, search
    moderator: approve_user, disable_user, enable_user, modify_own_user, view_dashboard, add_comment, approve_comment,
            delte_comment, edit_comment, reject_comment, view_own_logs, approve_article, create_article, disable_article,
            edit_own_article, enable_article, publish_article, view_article, search
    guest: register, view_article,search, add_comment



 NOTIFICATIONS
====================================================================================================


EVENIMENT | NOTIFICARE SUGERATA
Articol aprobat | „Articolul tău X a fost aprobat.”
Articol respins / dezactivat | „Articolul Y a fost dezactivat de un admin.”
Comentariu nou | „Ai un comentariu nou la articolul Z.”
Like / dislike | „Articolul tău a primit un like.”
Feedback pe articol (modificare admin) | „Adminul a editat articolul Q.”
Cont dezactivat | „Contul tău a fost dezactivat temporar.”
Setări ACL schimbate | „Rolul tău sau permisiunile au fost modificate.”